wp-content/uploads/woocommerce-placeholder-1024x1024.png 1024w, http://safety.local/wp-content/uploads/woocommerce-placeholder-150x150.png 150w, http://safety.local/wp-content/uploads/woocommerce-placeholder-768x768.png 768w, http://safety.local/wp-content/uploads/woocommerce-placeholder-624x624.png 624w, http://safety.local/wp-content/uploads/woocommerce-placeholder.png 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a>                                \n    							     Product 1&nbsp;\n    							     Qty: <strong>9</strong>\n						</td>\n						<td>\n						<bdi>&#36;0.00</bdi>						</td>\n					</tr>\n										<tr>\n						<td>\n                                <a href=\"http://safety.local/cart/?remove_item=7eabe3a1649ffa2b3ff8c02ebfd5659f&#038;_wpnonce=7028237e62\" aria-label=\"Remove this item\" data-product_id=\"206\" data-product_sku=\"\" data-balloon-pos=\"up\" data-balloon=\"Remove\">&times;</a>                                \n                                    <a href=\"http://safety.local/product/product-2/\"><img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"http://safety.local/wp-content/uploads/woocommerce-placeholder-300x300.png\" alt=\"Placeholder\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"http://safety.local/wp-content/uploads/woocommerce-placeholder-300x300.png 300w, http://safety.local/wp-content/uploads/woocommerce-placeholder-100x100.png 100w, http://safety.local/wp-content/uploads/woocommerce-placeholder-600x600.png 600w, http://safety.local/wp-content/uploads/woocommerce-placeholder-1024x1024.png 1024w, http://safety.local/wp-content/uploads/woocommerce-placeholder-150x150.png 150w, http://safety.local/wp-content/uploads/woocommerce-placeholder-768x768.png 768w, http://safety.local/wp-content/uploads/woocommerce-placeholder-624x624.png 624w, http://safety.local/wp-content/uploads/woocommerce-placeholder.png 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></a>                                \n    							     Product 2&nbsp;\n    							     Qty: <strong>2</str